    "The intended balance. Deadline is reachable if you run a tight site.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The intended balance. Deadline is reachable if you run a tight site."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El equilibrio previsto. La fecha se alcanza si llevas la obra con orden."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Difficulty description"
    },
    "The last update did not land well. Confidence took a knock.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The last update did not land well. Confidence took a knock."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El último reporte no cayó bien. La confianza se resintió."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Incident description"
    },
    "The launch date is contractual. Brutal if you slip, generous if you land early.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The launch date is contractual. Brutal if you slip, generous if you land early."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La fecha de lanzamiento es contractual. Brutal si te atrasas, generoso si llegas antes."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Counterparty description"
    },
    "The platform went down with it. Nothing shipped while everyone firefought.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The platform went down with it. Nothing shipped while everyone firefought."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La plataforma se cayó con él. No se entregó nada mientras todos apagaban el fuego."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Incident description"
    },
    "The previous session ended without reaching the background and without a crash signal. This usually means the system terminated the app for using too much memory, or it stopped responding.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The previous session ended without reaching the background and without a crash signal. This usually means the system terminated the app for using too much memory, or it stopped responding."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La sesión anterior terminó sin pasar a segundo plano y sin señal de cierre inesperado. Normalmente significa que el sistema cerró la app por usar demasiada memoria, o que dejó de responder."
          }
        }
      },
      "comment": "Diagnostic detail"
    },
